; The integration suite (DESIGN.md, "Tests"): Cistern's own client against a
; real server of make db-up. It is an executable, not a test stanza: dune
; runtest and the checks of the flake never need a server, and the mutation
; gate does not run it (it is not in SUITES). make integration SERVER=<name>
; runs it with CISTERN_DB_ENV, the absolute path of .db/<name>/env.

(executable
 (name integration)
 (libraries
  cistern
  cistern.core
  cistern.mysql
  weft-tls
  tls
  x509
  mirage-crypto-rng
  mirage-crypto-rng.unix
  ptime
  unix
  weft
  weft.flow
  weft.os
  windtrap))

; The model of the text of DOUBLE (claim C10) is that of the property suite.

(copy_files# ../prop/server_text.ml)
